pref-conditionals-hint = Select some text and press “Insert a block” to wrap it in {"{{"}#if variable{"}}"}…{"{{"}/if{"}}"}; without a selection an empty block is made and the caret lands between the two tags.
pref-template-hint = The template is Markdown. Use {"{{"}variable{"}}"} to insert a value and {"{{"}#if variable{"}}"}…{"{{"}/if{"}}"} to include a part only when the variable is not empty — the {"{{"}else{"}}"} in between is its other branch. The preview uses a real annotation from your library.

